<section class="shell band">
  <h1>Trauma, anxiety and depression therapy in Texas</h1>
  <div class="answer">
    <p>Reem Glasco, LPC-S, sees a small number of adults and young adults for developmental
    trauma, C-PTSD, anxiety, panic attacks, depression, procrastination and life transitions.
    Sessions are 50 minutes, self-pay, online anywhere in Texas, with
    Blue Cross Blue Shield accepted.
    Because her caseload is limited by her supervision and consultation work, most new clients
    are seen by the practice's <strong>LPC Associates</strong>, who have openings including at
    sliding-scale fees. Trail walk sessions are available in person in central Texas for adults
    for an hour.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="cta-row">
    <a class="cta" href="/contact/">Request a free 15-minute consult</a>
    <a class="cta cta--quiet" href="/faq/">See fees</a>
    <a class="cta cta--quiet" href="/blog/">Reem's notes</a>
  </div>
</section>

