<section class="shell band">
  <h2>Who this is for</h2>
  <div class="split">
    <div>
      <p>Adults and young adults, including college-age clients. The practice does not work
      with young children.</p>
      <p>Alongside the four paths above, people come here for life transitions, graduating,
      leaving, arriving, becoming a parent, losing someone, and for self care for mothers,
      which usually starts with permission.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>Trail walk, movement and equine sessions are for adults only, and need a consult plus
      one to three online sessions first, so we know each other before we are outside.</p>
      <p>You do not have to sort yourself into the right page before making contact. The four
      overlap a great deal, and the consult is where the starting point gets chosen.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

